  "body": "## v16.52 \u2014 merged; actual-merge certification replay running\n\nThe recursive constructor and independent verifier passed the frozen campaign: **7,236 directed cases, 263,927 legal moves, zero construction failures**, including 2,412 root-target-two cases. Total excursion stays \u22641; 3,491 cases use unit excursion. The independent analytical review establishes the same interface by structural induction for finite ordered trees whose internal arity is two or three. Finite validation checks the implementation; it does not replace that proof.\n\n- Immutable preregistration: `693d0a77a83dbc2f162ad3bf655b386dc92a764e`.\n- Verified integrated parent: `76f373c8940433efc463762e675daf3e231f8cb5`.\n- Definitive source: `0db3ea122068aa7f8aa7939ac768cf00c0a40a98`.\n- Exact published head: `dc789bbfd589605914ad3ebb24e2807e499e6f22`; tree `5ed399a585f1025be27ded565ae3aebea769fd99`.\n- [Full primary/reproduction workflow](https://github.com/proteinfoldingengine/WetLabEngine/actions/runs/36909923039): terminal success. Separate, overlapping runner executions each passed **1,150 checks = 1,071 inherited + 79 new**. All 39 inherited and all 42 total deterministic scientific files match byte for byte.\n- Complete source objects, original raw archives, certificates, logs, checksums and API provenance are durable at this head. Downloaded API digests, all 287 publication-manifest members, Git blobs and unchanged scientific source were audited.\n\nPreserved genuine RED: verifier/absent producer run36904469389 (2 intended failures, 0 errors); nested/mixed behavior run36907223873 (2/0); source-review regressions run36908623549 (3/0). All 79 final GREEN controls passed in run36909426860. Independent source review accepted corrections for partial transport-path retention, enforced assertion hashes, and resource failures classified as INCOMPLETE.\n\nDisclosed refinements: the prospective, separately tagged canonical-coverage control protocol preceded RED; the original scientific preregistration and all 7,236 identities remain unchanged. Execution used an API-backed isolated source mirror with all numerical science/tests on GitHub. Large original archives were transferred as verified 24 MiB parts on a separate audit-only branch ([transfer run](https://github.com/proteinfoldingengine/WetLabEngine/actions/runs/36912152091)); reconstructed bytes match original API SHA-256 and sizes. No scientific source change or extra science execution was introduced by transfer.\n\nIndependent exact-head review APPROVED dc789bbfd589605914ad3ebb24e2807e499e6f22 with no Critical, Important or Minor findings. Exact-head merge completed as `b6bf95798ec5892963c29f4020f8b75069fd2e3b`; ordered parents and publication-tree equality verified. [Actual-merge full replay](https://github.com/proteinfoldingengine/WetLabEngine/actions/runs/36917113237) and independently accepted durable receipt are the remaining closure gates. **NOT YET CLOSED/CERTIFIED.** Higher arity and physical interpretation remain outside scope. A failed construction is not a nonunit certificate.\n",
